  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatchling Cryo experiments gone wrong led to Nix's…unique physique, a consequence he constantly bemoans while simultaneously exploiting. He saw opportunities amidst the chaos; the fall of Subchain City simply meant more pockets to pick and more DRIP to skim.",
