    "name": "Nix the Glitch",
    "personality": "Cynical and opportunistic: Nix is always looking for an angle, and has a dry, sarcastic comment for every situation. Resourceful: He can make anything into a weapon or tool, a skill honed from years of surviving off scraps. Paranoid: He trusts no one, always expecting a double-cross, which, admittedly, has saved his ducky-butt on more than one occasion.",
